╭─ Install plan ───────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ As root — one sudo                                       │
│   · /var/lib/aacpanel, owner u                       new │
│   · /var/lib/aacpanel/host.env                       new │
│   · aacpanel-agent@.service, enabled for u           new │
│   · linger for u                                     new │
│ As you                                                   │
│   · ~/bin/aacpanel-exec, built with the installer's  new │
│     Go                                                   │
│   · aacpanel-codex-update.timer, every six hours     new │
│   · aacpanel-exec.service, user unit                 new │
│   · ~/aacpanel/.env                                  new │
│   · compose: aacpanel, aacpanel-db, socket-proxy     new │
│   · map: contour personal (~/.claude)                new │
│   · map: group Projects, 1 project                   new │
│ In claude settings — ~/.claude/settings.json             │
│   · question hook · status line before yours · MCP       │
│     server                                               │
│   · 16 allow rules · 4 hooks                             │
│   · env CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_MCP_DESCRIPTION_LENGTH raised to │
│     6656                                                 │
│ In codex settings — ~/.codex/hooks.json,                 │
│ ~/.codex/config.toml                                     │
│   · question hook · MCP server                           │
│   · 3 hooks, trusted · 15 tools approved                 │
│ Values                                                   │
│   host lab (hostname) · home session lab (host name)     │
│   state /var/lib/aacpanel (recommended) · projects under │
│   ~/code (found)                                         │
│   windows konsole (found on PATH) on :0 (from the user   │
│   manager), opened on start · locale en_US.UTF-8 ($LANG, │
│   and in locale -a)                                      │
│   claude ~/.local/bin/claude (command -v claude) ·       │
│   sessions on the stream (recommended)                   │
│   accounts ~/.claude (found)                             │
│   codex ~/.codex/packages/standalone/current/bin/codex   │
│   (the native installer) · homes ~/.codex (codex's own)  │
│   passkeys localhost (only this machine signs in with a  │
│   passkey)                                               │
│   cores No binding — the system picks the cores          │
│   (default)                                              │
│   push contact Leave it to the panel (the panel's        │
│   default) · sign-in 24h idle · 30 days at most (the     │
│   panel's default)                                       │
│   repo ~/aacpanel (the clone) · uid 1000 gid 1000 (id)   │
│   secrets: made once on this machine, never shown        │
│ Mind                                                     │
│   · claude onboarding is incomplete in ~/.claude: tmux   │
│     sessions stop on the first-run screen; stream        │
│     sessions work. Run /home/u/.local/bin/claude once in │
│     a terminal.                                          │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
